--- !u!114 &7328403636326605183
MonoBehaviour:
  m_ObjectHideFlags: 0
  m_CorrespondingSourceObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabInstance: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabAsset: {fileID: 0}
  m_GameObject: {fileID: 5719141984925073207}
  m_Enabled: 1
  m_EditorHideFlags: 0
  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: d6e926151a8fc5d4c8db9a1f458d22f5, type: 3}
  m_Name: 
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Assembly-CSharp::BRATGUIStoryIntro
  chapters:
  - title: The grave
    narration: As children, the archer and her brother had a knock of their own.
      Two taps, a pause, then one more. Three evenings after she buried him, she
      heard it under his headstone. She was on her knees, clawing at the earth, before
      she remembered the coins she had laid on his eyes.
    illustration: {fileID: 3056313085897651061}
    layers:
    - image: {fileID: 2693861221181503550}
      travel: {x: -64.08003, y: 0}
      finalScale: 1
    - image: {fileID: 2082840191901815105}
      travel: {x: 0, y: 0}
      finalScale: 1
    travel: {x: 0, y: 0}
    finalScale: 1
    extraReadingTime: 0
  - title: What answered
    narration: The hunter lifted the grate. A horned demon crouched on the coffin,
      tapping the lid. His knife skidded off its hide. Then it laughed, and the laugh
      was her brother's. Hatred ran hot down the archer's bow arm. She knew that
      heat. Odium. Her arrow went clean through its hand.
    illustration: {fileID: 4755375286821286074}
    layers:
    - image: {fileID: 3013217280465830137}
      travel: {x: -60, y: -10}
      finalScale: 1
    - image: {fileID: 4310935172805519908}
      travel: {x: 70, y: 5}
      finalScale: 1
    travel: {x: 0, y: 0}
    finalScale: 1
    extraReadingTime: 0
  - title: The last watch
    narration: From his tower the watchman saw doors open all along the lane. A winged
      demon was leading the baker toward the old quarry by the hand. Three children
      followed with their coats on over their nightshirts. The watchman sounded the
      bell. Only those who had yet to hear a knock came running.
    illustration: {fileID: 3195958157322606039}
    layers:
    - image: {fileID: 3312022176214165724}
      travel: {x: -81, y: 27.000002}
      finalScale: 1
    travel: {x: 0, y: 0}
    finalScale: 1
    extraReadingTime: 0
  - title: The oath
    narration: At the shrine the watchman named the missing. The old knight laid
      his sword on the altar. "I worked that quarry in chains. So did some of the
      demons you'll find in the crypt at Red Hook. They know a way in." He put his
      hand on the blade. "Those children will sleep in their own beds again."
    illustration: {fileID: 4170960263211978735}
    layers:
    - image: {fileID: 2442310647448672006}
      travel: {x: 0, y: 0}
      finalScale: 1
    - image: {fileID: 2875763818659453404}
      travel: {x: -57.767677, y: 0}
      finalScale: 1
    travel: {x: 0, y: 0}
    finalScale: 1
    extraReadingTime: 0
  - title: The road in
    narration: The ranger's hound found flour on the bridge rail. Below it, a small
      bare footprint shone in the river mud. The captives were alive. The ranger
      stayed to follow their trail. The others took the road to Red Hook. This time,
      when her brother knocked from the trees, the archer kept walking.
    illustration: {fileID: 3737828309171781681}
    layers:
    - image: {fileID: 8745274728293821921}
      travel: {x: -61.662537, y: 0}
      finalScale: 1
    - image: {fileID: 8101870530637648176}
      travel: {x: 0, y: 0}
      finalScale: 1
    travel: {x: 0, y: 0}
    finalScale: 1
    extraReadingTime: 0
  - title: Before the dawn
    narration: At the gates of Red Hook Estate the knight pinned the demon's wounded
      hand to the gatepost. The archer slipped inside and made straight for the crypt.
      "Which of you got out of the quarry?" she called down the steps. "I need someone
      willing to fight beside me. We're bringing those children home."
    illustration: {fileID: 5402552694059215358}
    layers:
    - image: {fileID: 4098804034573203217}
      travel: {x: 60, y: -5}
      finalScale: 1
    - image: {fileID: 4150951490133389557}
      travel: {x: -60, y: 5}
      finalScale: 1
    travel: {x: 0, y: 0}
    finalScale: 1
    extraReadingTime: 0
